    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hi. Is everything all right with your meal?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Not really. I ordered the vegetable pasta, but this has chicken in it."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Oh, I'm really sorry. The kitchen mixed up two orders. The soup of the day is ready now, if you'd like that instead. It's chicken soup."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Thanks, but I'm vegetarian. I don't eat meat or chicken. And my lunch break ends in thirty minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I see. The kitchen can make a new vegetable pasta in about fifteen minutes. Or there's a vegetable salad with bread ready now. It's seven dollars, so I'd give you two dollars back."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Is the salad big enough for lunch?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "It's quite big, and it comes with bread. But the pasta is a bigger meal."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "My office is only five minutes away, so I can wait. I'll have the new pasta, please."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "No problem. A new vegetable pasta, no meat, in about fifteen minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Great. Please make sure there's no chicken this time."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Of course. It's completely vegetarian. Sorry again."
    }
  ],
